# 新实验

```asterlab
kind: experiment
id: exp-new
schema: 1
title: 新实验
experimental_unit: 一个独立实验单位
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-control
schema: 1
name: Control
role: control
```

```asterlab
kind: group
id: g-treatment
schema: 1
name: Treatment
role: treatment
```

```asterlab
kind: assay
id: assay-main
schema: 1
title: 检测
group_refs: [g-control, g-treatment]
timepoints: []
```

```asterlab
kind: step
id: step-1
schema: 1
title: 步骤 1
assay: assay-main
timepoints: []
path: ""
```

```asterlab
kind: workflow
id: wf-1
schema: 1
steps: [step-1]
edges: []
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: plate-1
schema: 1
format: 96
assay: assay-main
groups:
  g-control: []
  g-treatment: []
```
